From f67f7dd92d002352f29661bedbad596e6e1f3a7e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bsp2020 <bsp2020@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 19:58:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 00/50] ours base for r220: moe-expert-cache.cu stays at r206
 (r207+ host-pool work not carried, pool mode at r206)

r207-r220 rewrote the host pool path of moe-expert-cache.cu.  It overlaps code our series replaces, and production runs
--host-experts mmap.  Keep the r206 file, answer moe_cache_table_is_pool with false, and stub the new loader interface
(heat ranking, pool budget, fill mode).
